rong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","discount_percent":0,"final":1699,"final_formatted":"$16.99 USD","initial":1699,"initial_formatted":""},"publishers":["Flight School Studio"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia fantasiosa","rating":"l"},"igrs":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Kekerasan","rating":"13","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"13","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Fantasy-Gewalt","rating":"6","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"6","use_age_gate":"0"}},"recommendations":{"total":116},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"1 Jun, 2021"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cLike Studio Ghibli\u2019s Nausicaa of the Valley of the Wind, Stonefly\u2019s environment is as important as its characters \u2014 the push and pull between the two, the unnerving tension between humans and everything else around them. Stonefly\u2019s hopeful respect of the natural world shines through, a showcase of an aspirational balance.\u201d<br>POLYGON<br><br>\u201c....Provides an intriguing premise that lends itself to strange and fantastical gameplay... Stonefly smartly lets the player control its tempo without lingering for too long, which appeals to all kinds of gamers.\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 Noisy Pixel<br><br>\u201cStonefly is a thoroughly unique game that has novel gameplay ideas and a wonderful story. Dancing around the world while piloting your mech, trying to find emotional catharsis for your heroine while also beating up some bugs so you can get more resources to upgrade your current ride is a heck of a gameplay loop. It\u2019s well worth experiencing if you want a chill adventure.\u201d<br>8/10 \u2013 NintendoWorldReport<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198590/ss_23da115c37f0f3b51b7ad66f5dbe3b450c7afa0e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1654296935","path_thumbnail":"https://s